 {
  "id": "RULE-008",
  "name": "Function key dispatch: unrecognised keys give 'TECLA NO VALIDA'",
  "category": "validation",
  "priority": "P1",
  "statement": "On a re-entry the saved conversation state is restored and the pressed key decides what happens. PF3 has its own branch. A recognised key runs the order processing (2000-PROCESAR). Any other key shows the error 'TECLA NO VALIDA'.",
  "condition": "Not first time: EVALUATE EIBAID. WHEN DFHPF3 -> branch whose action is outside the slice. A WHEN branch whose key is not visible -> 2000-PROCESAR. WHEN OTHER -> invalid key.",
  "action": "Copy DFHCOMMAREA to WS-COMMAREA. For any other key, move 'TECLA NO VALIDA' to WS-MENSAJE and perform 8000-ENVIAR-ERROR.",
  "inputs": [
   {
    "name": "EIBAID",
    "type": "text(fixed,1,ebcdic)",
    "description": ""
   },
