  "scenarios": [
   "Scenario: Unrecognised key\n Given the user is on the payment order screen after the first display\n When the user presses a key that is not handled, for example PF9\n Then the message 'TECLA NO VALIDA' is shown on the screen",
   "Scenario: Processing key\n Given the user presses the key mapped to processing\n When the program evaluates the key\n Then 2000-PROCESAR runs"
